        {
            "jpName": "カジノドライヴ",
            "enName": "Casino Drive",
            "jpText": "（――東京から太平洋を隔てた海の彼方。\nアメリカの大地を、駆ける夢がある）",
            "enText": "(All the way across the Pacific Ocean,\nthere are those who aspire to run on\nAmerican soil.)",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "origClipLength": 233,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": -4765424900374927092,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "カジノドライヴ",
            "enName": "Casino Drive",
            "jpText": "（世界最大規模のレースイベント――\nそこに集うウマ娘たちは勝利の向こうに、\n果てしない夢を見る）",
            "enText": "(Horsegirls with the grandest of ambitions\nfind their way to the world's grandest\nracing event, their hearts set on victory.)",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "origClipLength": 293,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -8660904177396299340,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "カジノドライヴ",
            "enName": "Casino Drive",
            "jpText": "――ウマ娘の人生を変えるほどの大レース。\nそれが両手で足りないほど開催される祭典！",
            "enText": "A true racing festival of such prestige that\nvictory in any of its numerous races can\nchange horsegirls' whole lives!",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "origClipLength": 230,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 296,
                    "pathId": 3446772783794965874
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 2223491074962733067,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "カジノドライヴ",
            "enName": "Casino Drive",
            "jpText": "ここに夢を見たのは……私も貴方も同じです。",
            "enText": "You, me… all of us held these same dreams.",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "origClipLength": 142,
            "voiceIdx": 15,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 433,
                    "pathId": 8529038033766106227
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5645438657203228848,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "カジノドライヴ",
            "enName": "Casino Drive",
            "jpText": "ですからどうぞ、\nこの私に皆様の信用を。\nそれが、これから始まる挑戦へのチップです。",
            "enText": "So please, I ask everyone to put their trust\nin me. This upcoming challenge requires us\nall to lay down our chips on the table.",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "origClipLength": 262,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 162,
                    "pathId": 5243668453052694692
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 228,
                    "pathId": -5408587645192143041
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8098168812958635985,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "カジノドライヴ",
            "enName": "Casino Drive",
            "jpText": "さすればいずれ、皆様に――\n至上の景色をご覧にいれましょう。",
            "enText": "And you'll see — I will lead\nyou to the highest payout.",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "origClipLength": 183,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 184,
                    "pathId": 565344026604396714
